msgid "Custom format for folder items (multiple keymaps)\nTokens: I=Icon, C=Chord, G=All Groups, g=First Group, L=Label, N=Verbose Count (+3 keymaps), n=Compact Count (+3), S=Separator A, s=Separator B"
